<title>UK: BOXING-NASEEM HAMED RETAINS WBO FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-NASEEM HAMED RETAINS WBO FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Naseem Hamed retained his World Boxing Organisation (WBO) featherweight title when he stopped Argentina's Remigio Molina in the second round of their scheduled 10-round fight on Saturday.</p>
</text>
